// Directing to greeting
-> greeting

=== greeting === 
Stupid cloud formations. Of course it was silly of me to think the clouds would be any different today.

I predict this storm is going to be a bad one, Barrington. I’m not sure how hard it’ll be to weather this one.

I mean, I can easily swing through the trees with my tail, but yours seems to be cut a bit short. 

Here, take this item. I can’t quite make sense of it, but you might be able to swing along with me. #stickyGive

But hurry, I can’t predict when the thunder will start. #stickyGet
-> END 